{
  "job_B20.18.2_20251003_114511": {
    "text": "De diebus fesstis \u00e6rest from middan wintra bi\u00f0 to Sancta marian m\u00e6ssan V wucan and IIII niht.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s on V nihtum g\u00e6\u00f0 lengten on tun.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6s ymbe twa wucan and ymbe III niht bi\u00f0 Sancte mathias m\u00e6sse.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe twa wucan and twa niht bi\u00f0 Sancte gregorius m\u00e6sse.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6s ymbe ane wucan and ymbe ane niht bi\u00f0 Sancte cuthberhtes m\u00e6sse.\nAnd on morgen Sancte benedictus, and emnihte, and \u00f0\u00e6s on feower nihtum bi\u00f0 Sancta marian m\u00e6sse.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe feower wucan and ymbe \u00fereo niht bi\u00f0 se \u00e6nlipiga gangd\u00e6g.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe VI niht bi\u00f0 Sancte philippus m\u00e6sse and Iacobus.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe twa niht bi\u00f0 inuentio Sancte crucis.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe VI niht g\u00e6\u00f0 sumer on tun.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe twa wucan and ymbe III niht bi\u00f0 Sancte augustinus m\u00e6sse.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe IIII wucan and ymbe ane niht bi\u00f0 middes sumeres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g, and \u00fe\u00e6r is f\u00e6sten to.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe V niht bi\u00f0 Sancte petres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g, and on morgen Sancte paules, and \u00fe\u00e6r is f\u00e6sten to.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe III wucan and ymbe IIII niht bi\u00f0 Sancte iacobus m\u00e6sse, iohannes bro\u00f0or, and \u00fe\u00e6r is\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe ane wucan bi\u00f0 hlafm\u00e6ssand\u00e6g.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe VI niht g\u00e6\u00f0 h\u00e6rfest on tun.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe III niht bi\u00f0 Sancte laurentius m\u00e6sse, and \u00fe\u00e6r is f\u00e6sten to.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe V niht bi\u00f0 Sancte marian m\u00e6sse, and \u00fe\u00e6r is f\u00e6sten to.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe X niht bi\u00f0 Sancte bartholomeus m\u00e6sse, and \u00fear is f\u00e6sten to.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe IIII niht bi\u00f0 Sancte iohannes m\u00e6sse baptistae.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe X niht bi\u00f0 Sancta marian m\u00e6sse, and \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe XIII niht bi\u00f0 Sancte matheus\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe III niht bi\u00f0 emniht.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe V niht bi\u00f0 Sancte michaheles m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe IIII wucan and ymbe ane niht bi\u00f0 Sancte simones m\u00e6sse and Taddeus, and \u00fear is f\u00e6sten\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe IIII nihtum bi\u00f0 ealra halgena m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g, and \u00fe\u00e6r is f\u00e6sten to.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe VI niht g\u00e6\u00f0 winter on tun.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe IIII niht bi\u00f0 Martinus m\u00e6sse.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe XII niht bi\u00f0 Sancte clementes m\u00e6sse, and \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe VII niht bi\u00f0 Sancte andreas m\u00e6sse,\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s ymbe IIII niht bi\u00f0 middes wintres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g.",
